---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="My First Post - John Doe" currentPath="/blog">
  <div class="container">
    <article>
      <h1>My First Post</h1>
      <p class="post-meta">January 15, 2024</p>
      
      <p>Welcome to my blog! This is my first post, and I'm excited to start sharing my thoughts and experiences.</p>
      
      <h2>Why I Started Writing</h2>
      <p>I believe that writing things down is one of the most powerful habits you can develop. It helps you clarify your thoughts, remember ideas, and share knowledge with others.</p>
      
      <p>Through this blog, I hope to document my journey, share what I learn, and maybe help others along the way.</p>
      
      <h2>What to Expect</h2>
      <p>I'll be writing about:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Software engineering and web development</li>
        <li>Tools and workflows that improve productivity</li>
        <li>Personal development and learning</li>
        <li>Interesting projects I'm working on</li>
      </ul>
      
      <p>Stay tuned for more!</p>
    </article>
    
    <p><a href="/blog">← Back to blog</a></p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post-meta {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    margin-bottom: 2em;
  }
</style>
